WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.880
Ringo flew after the cargo ship.

2
00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:09.611
But he didn't catch it.

3
00:00:09.612 --> 00:00:15.700
"Oh well," he said. "I give up."

4
00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:19.897
Ringo grinned and turned around. "See?

5
00:00:19.898 --> 00:00:23.663
I told you it was a smart plan!"

6
00:00:23.664 --> 00:00:27.438
"What about Lucy?" Diva asked.

7
00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:30.698
"She's in my spaceship."

8
00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:35.841
"Lucy knows what to do," Ringo said.

9
00:00:35.842 --> 00:00:39.950
Donny frowned. "You tricked the kidnapper.

10
00:00:39.951 --> 00:00:43.088
But we still have to get to Concert Planet."

11
00:00:43.089 --> 00:00:49.086
"What if the kidnapper finds me again?" Diva said.

12
00:00:49.087 --> 00:00:52.861
Ringo showed Diva a screen.

13
00:00:52.862 --> 00:00:56.752
"The kidnapper is far away.

14
00:00:56.753 --> 00:01:05.521
You're safe now, Diva."

15
00:01:05.522 --> 00:01:17.036
"Bot, take us to Concert Planet!"

16
00:01:17.037 --> 00:01:39.802
The cargo ship arrived at a spaceport.

17
00:01:39.803 --> 00:01:43.603
The pilot stepped out and combed his hair.

18
00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:47.542
He held up a bunch of flowers.

19
00:01:47.543 --> 00:01:51.678
"Finally!" he said. "I will meet Diva.

20
00:01:51.679 --> 00:01:56.059
And she will sing only for me!"

21
00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:00.161
The ship's side door opened.

22
00:02:00.162 --> 00:02:03.421
"Diva!" the kidnapper said.

23
00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:06.196
"You can come out of your ship now.

24
00:02:06.197 --> 00:02:10.040
It's me—your biggest fan!"

25
00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:13.069
Slowly someone stepped out.

26
00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:21.379
The kidnapper gasped.

27
00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:29.179
"Who are you?"

